{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A VISCERAL NEW NIGHTMARE BEGINS</strong><br><br>Descend into the sprawling underworld of a moon ruled by a psychic order, whose sinister secrets have broken free. Play as both rogue enforcer, and exiled psychic as you fight, flee, navigate puzzles, and invoke psionic powers in this otherworldly survival horror.\u00a0 <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988960/extras/d515f449d63f2f2cdb2d904f6c119e9c.avif?t=1759998080\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TWO ROGUES DESCEND BENEATH THE ICE</strong><br><br><br>Play as both the rogue enforcer Kalsang, and the exiled psychic Dahla as you explore the sprawling labyrinth of the Paladisium. As Kalsang, utilize stealth, nimbleness, and a touch of violence to survive the psychic abominations that stalk the halls.\u00a0 <br>  <br>Tap into Dahla's growing arsenal of psychic powers to project her consciousness to remote locations, see the unseen with her psionic senses, and unleash telekinetic explosions.\u00a0<br><br>Gather resources, clues, tools, weapons, and no matter what- keep the Spire spinning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988960/extras/872028974667fd605403596714909e97.avif?t=1759998080\" width=1560 height=691 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A LABRYNTH OF HORRORS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Paladisium is sprawling, and the horrors it once held have broken free. Evade a relentless abomination driven to deliver you a fate worse then death, while the Paladisium's many other terrors grow more numerous and varied with every corner.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988960/extras/5ba0de3d7e23b51ad3985a3dca5a8406.poster.avif?t=1759998080\" width=400 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988960/extras/5ba0de3d7e23b51ad3985a3dca5a8406.webm?t=1759998080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DYSTOPIAN PROPHECIES</strong>\u00a0<br><br>Descend beneath the ice of Titan, where a dark conspiracy unravels with the disappearance of Titan's tyrannical ruler.\u00a0Uncover an existential mystery, solve puzzles, and manipulate  psionic technology to unlock the secrets of this place and the red glow shifting beneath you.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a lore rich world of oppressive doom, where human identity and purpose is all but choked out in the Final Kingdom. And while a spark of hope lingers in these dark halls, you are not the only rogue forces desperate to steer the Kingdom's future. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988960/extras/b25ad6d6f8cf4eb034d775fedadd720d.avif?t=1759998080\" width=1560 height=560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3988960?t=1759998080","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988960/4678b6135fea8fac002a21397db082d8ed7affa2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759998080","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988960/57fae1450ff64f90d5e3c70cfe303215b4ca63c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759998080","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988960/57fae1450ff64f90d5e3c70cfe303215b4ca63c6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759998080","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Rogues of Titan contains references to dark topics, implies the past occurrence of violence or murder through traces of blood found in the environment, and scenes involving the player character being killed by enemies with disturbing appearances. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A VISCERAL NEW NIGHTMARE BEGINS</strong><br><br>Descend into the sprawling underworld of a moon ruled by a psychic order, whose sinister secrets have broken free. Play as both rogue enforcer, and exiled psychic as you fight, flee, navigate puzzles, and invoke psionic powers in this otherworldly survival horror.\u00a0 <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988960/extras/d515f449d63f2f2cdb2d904f6c119e9c.avif?t=1759998080\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TWO ROGUES DESCEND BENEATH THE ICE</strong><br><br><br>Play as both the rogue enforcer Kalsang, and the exiled psychic Dahla as you explore the sprawling labyrinth of the Paladisium. As Kalsang, utilize stealth, nimbleness, and a touch of violence to survive the psychic abominations that stalk the halls.\u00a0 <br>  <br>Tap into Dahla's growing arsenal of psychic powers to project her consciousness to remote locations, see the unseen with her psionic senses, and unleash telekinetic explosions.\u00a0<br><br>Gather resources, clues, tools, weapons, and no matter what- keep the Spire spinning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=